  # Open-Source Agent Memory:Mem0 vsLetta vs _Zep_
Mem0, Letta and Zep are the three most-starred standalone open-source memory projects, and they make three incompatible bets on what remembering means: passive fact extraction, agent-curated tiers, and a temporal knowledge graph.

